  "raw_text": "d. What was the second part of the question? Agent: You're right, I also asked about the smell. What does the Mexican Pizza typically smell like to you? User: It smells pretty much like a taco. It smells pretty good. Agent: Thank you. Now, what are the top two or three things that make the Mexican Pizza \"perfect\" for you? User: The variety of options. You can get it made up many different ways with many different flavors and like condiments and you can get like beef or beans, cheese, tomatoes, the spices, and the sauces. Agent: That's great to know about the customization options. On the flip side, what are the top two or three things that would make the Mexican Pizza \"bad\" for you? For example, if it were soggy, dry, or cold. User: Yes, I think if it was dry, it would not be very good because everyone I've ever got has been pretty moist and juicy even sometimes. So I definitely wouldn't want to eat one if it was dry. Cold, I don't think I'd want to eat it cold either. You definitely w",
